Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.22,0:00:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,.com
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,11
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.83,0:00:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,,000-1695-660
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.38,0:01:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After Devimon destroyed File Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt and I were stranded\Nin a freezing environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On another island, Tai and Agumon encountered\NFrigimon, a victim of the Black Gears.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.70,0:01:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got Bridgimon back to his\Nkind self, and in gratitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.86,0:01:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he created a bridge to our island.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:01:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we found each other, things\Nwent badly between Matt and Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:02:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got even worse\Nwhen Mojyamon attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon and I digivolved\Nand defeated Mojyamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do hope we find all the others soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.56,0:02:15.03,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Kentarumon the Defender!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sego-sha, Kentarumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.85,0:02:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kendall and I would say we're\Ntraveling at a very high
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speed plummeting toward an\Nunidentified island, Panda,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crash landing is imminent Try to think\Nof it as if we're just hitting the beach
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.32,0:02:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that should be good for some frequent\Nflyer miles Are you alright, Mimi? Oh no,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.72,0:02:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,humidity Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some kind of tropical\Nrainforest but not one I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,familiar with it all happened\Nso fast Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you any idea what\Nhumidity does to my hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It goes like, oh, pootily.\NNot a pretty sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, perhaps we ought to look around and\Nsee if we can find any of the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.06,0:02:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can at least find some\Nair conditioning or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, here we are, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly the light and greasy island-style\Nlodgings I was expecting to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.40,0:03:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, very interesting, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't you think we should\Nkeep searching for the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, now really isn't the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.74,0:03:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but just look at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's prodigious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta check it out,\NTentomon, just for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, bud, just for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yum, bananas!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.62,0:03:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Banana?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you reach high enough? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was really starved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can pretend we're having\Nbanana splits, huh, Palmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.06,0:03:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They certainly do look delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.30,0:03:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is seriously\Ngetting on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that hair, Moose?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.16,0:03:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, goodbye. Meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.10,0:03:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He means hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.01,0:03:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:03:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, who's the talking dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:04:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Sukamon and Chuumon,\Nalso known as the Digi-Losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.06,0:04:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.84,0:04:11.81,Sign,Sign,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Sukamon
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.84,0:04:11.81,Sign,Sign,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.84,0:04:11.81,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Mutant Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.84,0:04:11.81,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.84,0:04:11.81,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.84,0:04:11.81,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.84,0:04:11.81,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Poop
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sukamon and his mouse\Nbuddy are always together
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.88,0:04:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because they share the\Nsame teeny tiny brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.37,0:04:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave us alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're okay, but first you\Ngotta pay a what do you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.60,0:04:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay a toll!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.65,0:04:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean a toll?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.74,0:04:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does she think she can\Nuse our woods for free?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.02,0:04:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's gotta pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.18,0:04:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like that, uh, purse there, for instance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like the hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.92,0:04:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What part of no don't you\Nunderstand, you wackazoids?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she insulted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.86,0:04:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo, Einstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.66,0:04:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.57,0:04:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let her have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.74,0:04:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it again. Do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it. I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see the camp therapist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's better than two\Nin ten foils. I feel all
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dingly and refreshed like\Na whole new person Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're a whole new person Is this one\Nas much of a pain as the last one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, really, we'll be nice from now\Non, really So you'll leave us alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, first tell us if you've seen\Nany other humans around here Any what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Creatures that look like this one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, as a matter of\Nfact Oh yeah, I forgot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.36,0:05:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.74,0:05:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, it wasn't nearly as\Npretty as you are, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we saw something fall into\Nthe old ruins with the Tentomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when were you planning\Non telling us next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have seen Izzy, too, Belmont.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you two, can you take us there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important that we find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, okie-dokie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No funny business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cross our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And hope to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have all the absolutely\Nridiculous things to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.70,0:05:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.48,0:06:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.45,0:06:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, that's great. Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to get over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one with the big hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.22,0:06:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gorgeous girl like you\Nmust have a big brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you go, maybe you give\Nus a big thank you kiss, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.78,0:06:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please tell me they're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Climb aboard quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe we jump the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.01,0:06:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just the thought of that\Nkiss is making me queasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.26,0:06:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.26,0:06:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll wait till you come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hold your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Izzy, I highly suggest putting\Nan end to this architectural tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I mentioned before,\NI'm gathering information.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this place is\Ncrawling with clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's one of Devamon's black gears.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:07:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we keep this gear from turning,\Nwe'll completely jam that creep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or even better, we could not do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then we can go look for the others like\Nwe should have done in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.68,0:07:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the same writing\Nwe saw the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It made me realize that in DigiWorld,\Nbasic data is a living, viable substance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that data is stored on my hard drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only there was a power source here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a power source.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop the gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.24,0:07:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is find our friends on that list.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.52,0:07:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those lights are getting\Npower from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, an outlet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.35,0:07:38.82,Sign,Sign,0,270,90,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}On.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.92,0:07:38.82,Sign,Sign,240,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}Running.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It works!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, goody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see if I can decipher this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here are the old ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.70,0:07:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope that giant kissy-faced\Nlemon custard was telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One way to find out! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's them! Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.80,0:08:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon and Izzy! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.62,0:08:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, a friendly face!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the rest of the gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, uh, shouldn't we, like,\Nlook for them or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm trying to\Ndecipher these hieroglyphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, can't that wait, if\Nyou don't mind my asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I keep telling him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go and look for the others,\NI say, but does he listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, get up, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the key to figuring\Neverything out is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.76,0:08:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question is, does each glyph\Nrepresent a letter, a word, or a phrase?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to cross-reference\Nthe characteristics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, any idea how long\Nthis is going to take?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.02,0:08:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, can we go sometime\Nbefore winter sets in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, your friend is\Nasking you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:09:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, her rear end's getting cold,\Nsitting on the stone floor, doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.20,0:09:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, that might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ignoring me, you\Ncomputer geek pipsqueak?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.10,0:09:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so if I make the variable constant\Nand search for bottle patterns...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, here's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prodigious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.03,0:09:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These ruins are a gigantic maze
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try, Mimi. Oh no, not you\Ntoo. Izzy, do something. Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My laptop can't do everything I don't\Nknow, tell her you're sorry Sorry for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore I haven't had
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything to eat in my\Nfeet You're killing me in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a giant limit because\Nyou're trying to kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me and all I want to\Ndo is get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just want to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Izzy, how can\Nyou be so insensitive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insensitive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.23,0:09:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ignore us while you\Npoke away at your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:09:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not ignoring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing something ultra-important,\Nlike maybe saving this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can just decipher these\Nhieroglyphs, then maybe we could...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.94,0:10:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You escape your stupid hieroglyphics.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.30,0:10:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just like playing on\Nyour computer, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm just playing around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost think you like\Ncomputers more than people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look now, but Mimi\Nand Tentomon are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never recommend\Nthis resort to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear. Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.58,0:10:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why is all this happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, we've got to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.34,0:10:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One wrong turn and we\Ncan get lost in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.86,0:10:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want to do is get back\Nhome. That's all. Please, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.60,0:10:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really think we ought\Nto find our way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want my own bed, my own bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm even starting to miss my baby brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, stop running off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see them anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where could they have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't go deeper\Ninto the maze, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be my guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These deciphered hieroglyphs tell me the\Ninside of these ruins is a giant labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if that is the case, they\Ncould be lost in there forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forever? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.84,0:11:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, Tentomon? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get the feeling we're sort\Nof going around in circles?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See this sooty smudge on the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember passing it a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be that we're lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realize this is probably a bad time\Nto say I told you so, but... Oh, quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.36,0:11:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't bear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.51,0:11:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And get lost, too? No, Palmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have got to use our heads first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:12:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can't just leave them. We won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.96,0:12:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is one super complicated maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to try to get a handle on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then maybe I can help get them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, being lost isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.58,0:12:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great. Oh, dear. Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.98,0:12:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting used to it by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'd just got to chill it and kept,\Nnone of this would have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try a systematic approach to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we just keep turning to\Nthe left or something like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I listen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.80,0:12:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your friend Izzy that got me\Ninto this mess in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't be too hard on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.40,0:12:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.31,0:12:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he gets a little wrapped\Nup in his work and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't always interact well with others,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.04,0:12:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.54,0:12:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Mimi, that blinking light?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, not that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll buzz off. Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.74,0:12:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've honed in on the\Nsignal from her digivice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can hear her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:12:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope she can hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy to Mimi, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Repeat, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mimi, I'm going to navigate for\Nyou, so walk exactly where I tell you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.32,0:13:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, he knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that you, pal mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do what Izzy tells you and you'll\Nbe out of there before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you Izzy was a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.64,0:13:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now take the first\Ndoorway on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.92,0:13:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you get to the end, turn left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But be careful of the next room because
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a big hole in\Nthe middle of the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There should be a narrow ledge\Nyou can use to get across.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, did we have to\Ntake the scenic route?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, uh-oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.54,0:13:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kate, I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping it was just a glitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:14:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's definitely something in that\Nmaze with them, and it's moving closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I am starting to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, what's with the silent treatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounded evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, it's been such a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.32,0:14:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.42,0:14:23.39,Sign,Sign,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Kentarumon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.42,0:14:23.39,Sign,Sign,370,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.42,0:14:23.39,Sign,Sign,370,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Beast Man Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.42,0:14:23.39,Sign,Sign,370,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.42,0:14:23.39,Sign,Sign,370,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.42,0:14:23.39,Sign,Sign,370,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.42,0:14:23.39,Sign,Sign,370,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Hunting Cannon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,St.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deramon, half man, half horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really don't want to get\Non either of his bad sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like a good chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a left!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, we are quite anxiously awaiting\Nyour directions. Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another lap, through the doorway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.70,0:14:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great job, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.45,0:14:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do we go now, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We seem to have lost contact with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? He's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.84,0:14:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Solar rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.22,0:14:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.74,0:15:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at my skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your bravery is noted, but that\Nalone will not gain you any mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make yourself bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.32,0:15:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you mean you want me to digivolve,\NI'm afraid that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, impossible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what he means.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.74,0:15:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cannot protect you, so you have to hold\Nyour ground, and that's truly impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.37,0:15:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get throwing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.29,0:15:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how I'd like to, but if I'm\Nseparated from Izzy, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.20,0:15:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm in the\Nmiddle of saying something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.82,0:15:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.70,0:15:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Mimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palmon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave my friends alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.72,0:16:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon, Digivolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.52,0:16:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you get bigger, you\Nget a lot bigger, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch where you step!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.92,0:16:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one way to get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but this is no time for\Nus to start taking it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.36,0:16:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.92,0:16:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ElectroShocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.18,0:17:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's time for a needle spray!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.00,0:17:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That felt interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of those black ears\Nfell out of his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a good Digimon now? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That device on your bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the mystical symbol of the Digivice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.86,0:17:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These ruins are its temple,\Nand I am its guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.40,0:17:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that certainly looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digivice is a preserver of the light,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a last line of defense against the\Ndarkness that threatens existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't get that,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm starting to think they're\Nmore than just a cool accessory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To destroy them, the children. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I warn you, Centarumon,\Ndo not interfere with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Leomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.28,0:18:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't look, it's too\Nscary! Well, maybe a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.72,0:18:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, time's standing still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said no, Leomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.36,0:18:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The children possess the Digivice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the guardian of its temple,\NI must protect them as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect them from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.08,0:18:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fist of the Beast King!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Solar Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's stop this madness\Nbefore one of us is hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Viamond?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.64,0:18:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The children must be destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.99,0:19:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must meet some other children
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Digivice can stop him in his tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad kitty! Ow! Go on! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.68,0:19:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that got rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.42,0:19:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These things really are kind of amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A preserver of light against the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.56,0:19:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you order a pizza with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.62,0:19:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Centarumon, maybe with your help,\Nwe could stop this black ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.00,0:19:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I have neither\Nthe strength nor the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.12,0:19:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knowledge to oppose Devimon\Nand the powers of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.88,0:19:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you still going on about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.60,0:19:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When can we start looking\Nfor something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll just have to keep deciphering
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.68,0:19:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and analyzing these two\Nsets of hieroglyphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure all the answers\Nare in here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, isn't this where I came in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not seriously\Nstarting all that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.50,0:20:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not right now. Just a nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.18,0:20:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This black gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.64,0:20:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares about that dumb old thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.34,0:20:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want is lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.86,0:20:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the process has reversed itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just goes to show you that sometimes\Nthe simplest solution is actually the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not much of a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I knew you couldn't keep away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are we gonna go on a date or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.94,0:20:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, what's your phone number?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, he is persistent!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least blow us a kiss! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.06,0:20:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it like you mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you like us,\Nyou know you do, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish. Do you think you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.96,0:21:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish. Do you think you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.24,0:21:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, do you think you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.90,0:21:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, you can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.42,0:21:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not all that. It's all
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.42,0:21:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold, so it's cold.\NIt's a jacket with my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget. The sun will
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.40,0:22:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shine. I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so warm, that day, that time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.60,0:22:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want a wish for a wish\Nfor a wind. When I put the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.46,0:22:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wind in the wind I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.62,0:22:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See the tomorrow's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.44,0:22:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you. I wish I
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.44,0:22:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.56,0:23:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.04,0:25:00.00,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Dancing Ghosts! Bakemon

